  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've been thinking about a feature that would really take VRC to the next level, it involves parallel instances and automatic merging while keeping the characters same position. The idea was origially though of when I was looking for a way to get more people into my events because the servers would often be full. So the idea I came up with is have some sort of instance layering system that ties into the queue system that will automatically merge people into the new instance. This would prbably have to be a world created feature that is set up through unity, but it would work amazingly for clubs and even larger persistent worlds. This would take VRC to the next level and really give it a MMO like experience all while being relatively easy to implement. Maybe even tie it into persistent VRC+ worlds that can retain object data. if VRC needs help developing this feature my world coder I believe said they would be available to help implement it.",
